sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor M as Manager / Employee
  participant C as React client
  participant A as Express API
  participant D as PostgreSQL
  M->>C: Manager or Employee tab: Warehouse ID, ID, password
  C->>A: POST /api/auth/employee-login (portal)
  A->>D: Find owner by Warehouse ID
  A->>D: Find team member by employee ID
  D-->>A: member (role, status, hash, must change)
  A->>A: Check active, compare password
  alt Role does not match the tab
    A-->>C: 403 Use the other tab
  else Valid
    A->>A: Sign JWT {owner id, employee, member id}
    A-->>C: 200 token, role, must change password
    opt Temporary password
      M->>C: Enter new password
      C->>A: PUT /api/auth/employee-password
      A->>D: Save new hash, must change = false
    end
    C->>A: GET /api/auth/employee-permissions
    A-->>C: permission map
    C-->>M: Dashboard with permitted modules only
  end
